      "description": "Analyze the user query: \"{query}\".\nSteps: 1. Call recommend_hybrid_agentic_workflow to load the canonical hybrid KG + text stack 2. search_design_patterns for query-specific matches 3. expand_design_patterns for supplementary patterns 4. traverse_pattern_neighborhood on the top 2 primary pattern numbers (max_depth=2) 5. get_design_pattern for any anchor pattern needing full metadata\nReturn a routing plan with: Workflow Stack, Primary Patterns, Expanded Patterns, and Graph Neighborhood findings.",
