    },
    {
      "id": "ff092d12-5ad4-4080-84ce-87d839e43c50",
      "description": "Using the routing plan, retrieve book-grounded technical context for EVERY listed pattern.\nFor each pattern number call retrieve_pattern_technical_context and consolidate: problem, solution, implementation, graph implementation notes, and code blocks.\nThen call reflect_on_hybrid_retrieval and validate_hybrid_retrieval for \"{query}\". If reflection action is \"expand\", note which patterns still need deeper retrieval.",
