      "id": "e4c34da0-574e-4343-bc4e-17a3fea84d10",
      "description": "Write the final recommendation for: \"{query}\".\nUse the routing plan, technical dossier, and quality evaluation. Structure as: 1. Recommended patterns (with numbers) mapped to our stack (graph.json + bundled book slices + Agent Studio hybrid RAG tools) 2. Technical implementation using book excerpts/code \u2014 NOT generic ChromaDB examples 3. Production tradeoffs, validation, guardrails (Patterns 10, 17, 31, 32)\nExplicitly note where our implementation differs from generic vector-GraphRAG tutorials.",
